 660:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  Function Name: Cy_BLE_GAPP_StartAdvertisement
 661:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  ***************************************************************************//**
 662:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *
 663:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  This function is used to start the advertisement using the advertisement data
 664:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  set in the BLE Component customizer's GUI indicated by the advertisingParamIndex.
 665:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  After invoking this function, the device will be available for connection by
 666:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  the devices configured for GAP central role. It is only included if the
 667:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  device is configured for GAP Peripheral or GAP Peripheral + Central role.
 668:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *
 669:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  On start of advertisement, GAP Peripheral receives the
 670:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPP_ADVERTISEMENT_START_STOP event. The following events are
 671:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  possible on invoking this function:
 672:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *
 673:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * #CY_BLE_EVT_GAP_DEVICE_CONNECTED - If the device connects to a GAP Central and
 674:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *     Link Layer Privacy is disabled.
 675:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * #CY_BLE_EVT_GAP_ENHANCE_CONN_COMPLETE - If the device connects to a GAP Central and
 676:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *     Link Layer Privacy is enabled.
 677:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * #CY_BLE_EVT_TIMEOUT: If no device in GAP Central mode connects to this
 678:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       device within the specified timeout limit. BLE Stack
 679:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       automatically initiate stop advertising when Slow
 680:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       advertising was initiated, or starts Slow advertising
 681:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       after Fast advertising timeout occur.
 682:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPP_ADVERTISEMENT_START_STOP: If device started or stopped
 683:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       advertising. Use Cy_BLE_GetAdvertisementState() to
 684:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       determine the state. Sequential advertising could be
 685:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                       started when #CY_BLE_ADV_STATE_STOPPED state is returned.
 686:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *
 687:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  \param advertisingIntervalType: Fast or slow advertising interval with timings
 688:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                                  entered in Advertising settings section of the
 689:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                                  customizer.
 690:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * CY_BLE_ADVERTISING_FAST   0x00u
 691:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * CY_BLE_ADVERTISING_SLOW   0x01u
 692:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * CY_BLE_ADVERTISING_CUSTOM 0x02u
 693:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *
 694:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  \param advertisingParamIndex: The index of the peripheral and broadcast
 695:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *                                configuration in customizer. For example:
 696:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c ****  *  * CY_BLE_PERIPHERAL_CONFIGURATION_0_INDEX     0x00
