 919:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** * Function Name: Cy_BLE_GAPC_StartScan
 920:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** ***************************************************************************//**
 921:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 922:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   This function is used for discovering GAP peripheral devices that are
 923:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   available for connection. It performs the scanning routine using the
 924:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   parameters entered in the Component's customizer indicated by
 925:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   scanParamIndex parameter.
 926:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 927:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   As soon as the discovery operation starts, #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_START_STOP
 928:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   event is generated. The #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_PROGRESS_RESULT event is
 929:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   generated when a GAP peripheral device is located. There are three discovery
 930:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   procedures can be selected in the customizer's GUI:
 931:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 932:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   * Observation procedure: A device performing the observer role receives only
 933:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                            advertisement data from devices irrespective of
 934:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                            their discoverable mode settings. Advertisement
 935:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                            data received is provided by the event,
 936:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                            #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_PROGRESS_RESULT. This procedure
 937:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                            requires the scanType sub parameter to be passive
 938:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                            scanning.
 939:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 940:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   * Discovery procedure: A device performing the discovery procedure receives
 941:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                          the advertisement data and scan response data from
 942:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                          devices in both limited discoverable mode and the
 943:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                          general discoverable mode. Received data is provided
ARM GAS  C:\Users\steel\AppData\Local\Temp\cceHW8wE.s 			page 18


 944:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                          by the event, #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_PROGRESS_RESULT.
 945:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                          This procedure requires the scanType sub-parameter
 946:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                          to be active scanning.
 947:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 948:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   Every Advertisement / Scan response packet is received in a new event,
 949:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_PROGRESS_RESULT.
 950:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   If 'scanTo' sub-parameter is a non-zero value, then upon commencement of
 951:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   discovery procedure and elapsed time = 'scanTo', #CY_BLE_EVT_TIMEOUT event
 952:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   is generated with the event parameter indicating #CY_BLE_GAP_SCAN_TO.
 953:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   Possible generated events are:
 954:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   * #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_START_STOP: If a device started or stopped scanning.
 955:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                                     Use Cy_BLE_GetScanState() to determine the
 956:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                                     state. Sequential scanning could be
 957:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                                     started when #CY_BLE_ADV_STATE_STOPPED
 958:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                                     state is returned.
 959:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   * #CY_BLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_PROGRESS_RESULT
 960:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   * #CY_BLE_EVT_TIMEOUT (CY_BLE_GAP_SCAN_TO)
 961:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 962:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   \param scanningIntervalType:  Fast or slow scanning interval with
 963:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *       timings entered in Scan settings section of the customizer.
 964:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *       * CY_BLE_SCANNING_FAST   0x00u
 965:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *       * CY_BLE_SCANNING_SLOW   0x01u
 966:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *       * CY_BLE_SCANNING_CUSTOM 0x02u
 967:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 968:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   \param scanParamIndex:  The index of the central and scan configuration
 969:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *                           in customizer.
 970:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *
 971:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gap.c **** *   \return
